    "notes": "Renderer/UI-only default visual orientation correction. The plastic trash-bin GLB and its top label now share one child visual group with rotation.y = -Math.PI / 2, so the body and text rotate together by 90 degrees clockwise in top view. The outer module group still owns persisted placement rotation, so placement.rotationZDeg, collision footprint, movement and persistence semantics are unchanged."
  },
